{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sganggs/Stronghold-Protocol/pulls/878","id":5001082642,"node_id":"PR_kwDOU4iKec8AAAABKhZ3Eg","html_url":"https://github.com/sganggs/Stronghold-Protocol/pull/878","diff_url":"https://github.com/sganggs/Stronghold-Protocol/pull/878.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/sganggs/Stronghold-Protocol/pull/878.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sganggs/Stronghold-Protocol/issues/878","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sganggs/Stronghold-Protocol/pulls/878/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sganggs/Stronghold-Protocol/pulls/878/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sganggs/Stronghold-Protocol/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sganggs/Stronghold-Protocol/issues/878/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sganggs/Stronghold-Protocol/statuses/2d5c9eccc5d427114db817279d3191e6331b2aba","number":878,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat: 卫戍协议：盟约 入场动画（含官方音效）与登录界面/大厅昼夜背景","user":{"login":"isomerpoi","id":310352349,"node_id":"U_kgDOEn-Z3Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/310352349?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/isomerpoi","html_url":"https://github.com/isomerpoi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isomerpoi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isomerpoi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isomerpoi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isomerpoi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isomerpoi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isomerpoi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isomerpoi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isomerpoi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isomerpoi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## 改动类型\n\n- [ ] fix: 修复\n- [x] feature: 功能\n- [ ] docs: 文档\n- [ ] refactor: 重构\n- [ ] test: 测试\n- [ ] chore: 维护\n\n## 改动说明\n\n- 改动说明：\n  - 新增「卫戍协议：盟约」的**入场动画**（`public/js/ui/entryFilm.js`）。打开网页、启动画面消失后播放，大约 2.3 秒，然后进入登录界面。它照官方录屏（30 fps）逐帧还原，曲线用实测关键帧加单调三次插值，不会冲过头。\n    - 浏览器不允许网页自动出声，所以先显示一张「点击进入」卡片，点一下同时解锁声音。动画期间也可以点一下跳过。\n    - 路由会直接进对局（重连）时不播放。\n  - 新增大厅的**昼夜场景**（`public/js/ui/allianceScene.js`），复刻活动大厅背景：20 秒一圈，夜景 → 黄昏扫入 → 回到夜景。\n    - **登录界面**的背景换成这个场景，和动画结尾无缝衔接（共用同一个循环时钟）。\n    - 登录界面中间的 logo 换成动画结尾的金字塔 season_logo，大小和动画结尾一致。\n    - **大厅** HubBackdrop 也用这个场景。\n  - 声音全部用资源包里的官方文件：开场音效 `act1autochess_g_ui_load`，大厅音乐 `m_sys_act1autochess_intro` 从头起播。\n  - 多语言：新增「点击进入」「点击跳过」两条文本，en / ja / ko / zh-TW 都已翻译；标题字样用已有的「卫戍协议」「盟约」。用拉丁字母的语言不再重复显示英文副标题。\n  - 回退方式：如果本地没有所需素材（`data/assets.json` 里缺对应的 ui 图），动画自动跳过，登录界面和大厅保持原来的背景和 logo，所以不会出现空白。\n  - `prefers-reduced-motion` 下不播放动画，背景保持静止。\n- 期望效果：每次进入游戏都有活动原版的入场演出和音效，登录界面和大厅背景与活动一致。\n- 关联 Issue / PR：无\n\n## 依据与假设\n\n- 来源依据：\n  - 画面按官方活动录屏逐帧比对：关键帧时间都以视频秒记录，可以在 `test/ui/alliance-scene.test.js` 里看到。\n  - 声音时序：对录屏音轨做互相关，结果如下。\n    - `g_ui_load` 在视频 1.6856 s，r = 0.988。\n    - 大厅音乐在 2.1444 s 从头开始，r = 0.998，带 audio.js 自带的 0.8 s 淡入。\n    - 录屏里没有其他音效。\n  - 所用素材都是 `data/assets.json` 里已有的 `ui/entry/*` 和 `ui/prepareBkg/*`。**没有提交任何游戏素材**。\n- [ASSUMED]：\n  - 开场音效的音量是 0.54，走 sfx 通道。这是按默认音量（音效 0.8、音乐 0.6）配出和录屏一致的混音比例，在代码里有注释。\n  - 手机竖屏时不播放动画（录屏是横屏的）。\n\n## 验证结果\n\n- 验证方法：本地服务器加无头 Edge，用中文和英文各走一遍「点击进入 → 动画 → 登录界面 → 大厅」。用 hook 记录 `AudioBufferSourceNode.start` 来量声音时序：音效到音乐的间隔实测 0.474 s / 0.452 s，录屏是 0.459 s。\n- 相关测试：新增 `test/ui/alliance-scene.test.js`（5 项：循环时刻、曲线无过冲、音频偏移、精灵都在 assets.json 里、文本都在各语言包里），全部通过。`node tools/i18n.mjs check --all --strict` 四种语言 100%。lint 和 check:imports 通过，docs-consistency 通过。\n- npm run ci：本地有 4 项失败，在不含本 PR 的 master 上同样失败，与本 PR 无关。原因是本机的 public/assets 是 0.3.1 的素材，缺少部分 Spine 模型和清单文件：\n  - `generated manifest data/assets.json`\n  - D3 slug models overlay\n  - 自选 summon models overlay\n  - 打包相关测试在提交后通过。\n- npm run golden：全部一致（roster 49、bonds 46、fields 22、matches 21、standins 10、diy 140）。\n- Golden 变化：无（纯界面改动）。\n- 截图/录屏：\n\n| | 中文 | English |\n|---|---|---|\n| 点击进入 | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/isomerpoi/Stronghold-Protocol/pr-screens/u_zh_gate.png) | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/isomerpoi/Stronghold-Protocol/pr-screens/u_en_gate.png) |\n| 动画 | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/isomerpoi/Stronghold-Protocol/pr-screens/u_zh_film.png) | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/isomerpoi/Stronghold-Protocol/pr-screens/u_en_film.png) |\n| 登录界面 | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/isomerpoi/Stronghold-Protocol/pr-screens/u_zh_title.png) | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/isomerpoi/Stronghold-Protocol/pr-screens/u_en_title.png) |\n| 大厅 | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/isomerpoi/Stronghold-Protocol/pr-screens/u_zh_lobby.png) | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/isomerpoi/Stronghold-Protocol/pr-screens/u_en_lobby.png) |\n\n## 适用性说明\n\n- 不适用项：规则文档、干员 kit Fidelity checklist\n- 原因：纯界面和演出改动，不涉及规则和数值。界面说明已更新 `docs/design/client.md`。\n\n## 检查清单\n\n- [x] 本 PR 只处理一个主题\n- [x] 已运行相关测试、npm run ci 和 npm run golden，并如实填写结果\n- [ ] 涉及规则时，已同步文档并运行文档检查\n- [ ] 涉及干员 kit 时，仅一名干员，并附上逐项勾选的 Fidelity checklist\n","labels":[{"id":12508022319,"node_id":"LA_kwDOU4iKec8AAAAC6YlGLw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sganggs/Stronghold-Protocol/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-25T02:17:36Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T15:23:49Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"9e2c5eee3ec5eaa49195d3c1295cd78c040c295c","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"isomerpoi:feat/alliance-entry-film","ref":"feat/alliance-entry-film","repo":{"id":1419368921,"node_id":"R_kgDOVJnZ2Q","name":"Stronghold-Protocol","full_name":"isomerpoi/Stronghold-Protocol","owner":{"logi